id: pm-dba47
title: "Dependabot 47 and Scorecard 29: patch indexed source-map offset denial of service"
description: "Post-merge main a7c662b4984a71d1b08d7909f616839705764ab8 reports Dependabot47 and reopened Scorecard29 for source-map-js1.2.1. High GHSA-68fv-2mgg-jv7q / CVE-2026-93749 affects >=1.0.0 <1.2.2; upstream fix1.2.2 was published2026-09-30T14:08:09.382Z and exceeds the pinned pnpm11 default one-day install minimum. The separate seven-day Dependabot version-update cooldown is unchanged. Installed dev edges are @eslint/css-tree magicast and postcss. npm audit and freshly updated Trivy currently admit the vulnerable version despite GitHub/OSV findings; independent safe installed-library controls establish the patch. No production exploit is established. Preserve both scanner identities under this one cause-specific owner without reopening completed Axios work."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 0
tags[1]: security
