author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: Resolve every source-map-js edge to a patched compatible release; retain existing mandatory scanner gates and release age; prove real isolated vulnerable/patched scanner controls; preserve frozen installs and tooling; independently verify native merged-main scanner retirement.
parent: pm-qwoy
risk: high
confidence: high
expected_result: No affected source-map-js remains in the locked or installed graph; existing test lint benchmark package and security contracts remain intact.
